  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5008.02 Inspection. All storage, processing or manufacturing facilities shall be subject to periodic and unannounced inspections by the commissioner for the purpose of determining compliance by the licensee with these rules.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 5000) #6055, eff 7-1-95, EXPIRED: 7-1-03\n\nNew. #8117, INTERIM, eff 7-14-04, EXPIRED: 1-10-05\n\nNew. #8261, eff 1-21-05; ss by #9765-A, eff 8-2-10; ss by #12124, eff 3-6-17",
